    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁποτέρ-ωσε</span></b> , Adv.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in which of two directions, to
